  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Plum chutney has a dark, fruity depth from the plums and spices,  warming with cinnamon and star anise, sharp from vinegar, sweet from the fruit and brown sugar. It works alongside game pie, cold pork, duck, and strong cheese. Whole plums go in,  the stones come out naturally as the fruit cooks. Makes about four 300 g jars."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
